msgid "{0}, {1}. Decoded here: the bytes are not sent anywhere."
msgstr "{0}, {1}. Decodificado aquí: los bytes no se envían a ningún sitio."

msgid "A document's bytes only mean something against its contract. Radar fetches the contract once, checks its proof here and keeps it to decode with."
msgstr "Los bytes de un documento solo tienen sentido junto a su contrato. Radar obtiene el contrato una vez, comprueba su prueba aquí y lo conserva para decodificar."

msgid "A field name in backticks is missing its closing backtick."
msgstr "A un nombre de campo entre acentos graves le falta el acento grave de cierre."

msgid "A field name was expected, but “{arg}” came instead."
msgstr "Se esperaba un nombre de campo, pero llegó “{arg}”."

msgid "A filter follows one index: the fields it names must be an index's leading fields, matched with == or IN, and the last of them may take a range (<, <=, >, >=, BETWEEN) or STARTS WITH. Add ORDER BY for each field you filter with a range or IN."
msgstr "Un filtro sigue un índice: los campos que nombra deben ser los primeros campos de un índice, comparados con == o IN, y el último puede usar un rango (<, <=, >, >=, BETWEEN) o STARTS WITH. Añade ORDER BY para cada campo que filtres con un rango o IN."

msgid "A name by its label"
msgstr "Un nombre por su etiqueta"

msgid "A number was expected, but “{arg}” came instead."
msgstr "Se esperaba un número, pero llegó “{arg}”."

msgid "A query is SELECT … FROM … WHERE conditions joined by AND, then GROUP BY, ORDER BY and LIMIT. JOIN, OR, OFFSET and sub-queries are unavailable because Platform answers from one index."
msgstr "Una consulta es SELECT … FROM … WHERE con condiciones unidas por AND, y después GROUP BY, ORDER BY y LIMIT. JOIN, OR, OFFSET y las subconsultas no están disponibles porque Platform responde desde un solo índice."

msgid "A statement can name a contract itself, as in FROM dpns.domain."
msgstr "Una sentencia puede nombrar el propio contrato, como en FROM dpns.domain."

msgid "A string is missing its closing quote."
msgstr "A una cadena le falta la comilla de cierre."

msgid "A sum over a range"
msgstr "Una suma sobre un rango"

msgid "A value was expected, but “{arg}” came instead."
msgstr "Se esperaba un valor, pero llegó “{arg}”."

msgid "A whole number was expected, but “{arg}” came instead."
msgstr "Se esperaba un número entero, pero llegó “{arg}”."

msgid "Action"
msgstr "Acción"

msgid "Add ORDER BY for every field filtered with a range (<, >, BETWEEN, STARTS WITH) or IN."
msgstr "Añade ORDER BY para cada campo filtrado con un rango (<, >, BETWEEN, STARTS WITH) o IN."

